  "content": "<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> ¡Hola! ~ 欢迎使用药水配方：原版版！</strong></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">感谢这个资源包，你在制作药水时能获得额外帮助，让过程更轻松，并节省大量时间，随时随地酿造任意药水。\n<br>\n你所需的一切帮助，尽在酿造台界面中！\n<br></h4>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b46eb6k-TWw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span>\n<br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fpixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/32237a5eb0e69b0cfb6f79b09d08bafae2139664.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fshadows_pixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6f8e5473c7cc891773d0963a204a7dbc0cae6ab8.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QrU6QCFj5r\" rel=\"nofollow\"> \n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab1d9434d86f69f02be997775cc20d9f968fc6a6.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc15ed1de151999554a0a966e39ccaef439d6d4d.png\" alt=\"Twitch\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fshadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2f10668a84476def0faf37c42319e0222484f94d.png\" alt=\"Instagram\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/shadowspixelforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b10f11429c9b97af2b45fcda64792d815fdeb5fb.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shadowspixelforge/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6aa1b4a7d469617ce0e922b931c24e73ef48dc59.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3qlCr9lXguH44qq5xqAlzQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/74af846b0dabfde51cc50f295809ec96f63e26a2.png\" alt=\"Youtube\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSPixelForge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eb699f87a889d2710efc5dcff9b6b023b2be2d58.png\" alt=\"X\" width=\"55\" height=\"50\"></a>\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2f227dd350f4e2322f500900863b7a6696b74f7.png\" alt=\"无需依赖\" width=\"660\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n<strong> 此资源包完美兼容原版Minecraft——无需额外模组。</strong> \n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/16b6589f1f80535554e90efd303b5eb53deccc80.png\" alt=\"拥抱暗黑面\" width=\"550\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/potion-recipes-dark-mode-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d0593dc091108c8dd613ae3b553c4ff977094f5a_0.webp\" alt=\"药水配方：暗黑模式\" width=\"700\" height=\"50\"> </a>\n<br><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c7f3b2837c699bc40bda584b7d5781389c4dbe3d.png\" alt=\"更多有趣项目\" width=\"690\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n<table style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;text-align:center\"> \n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shadows-pixels-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/81c5b3f05c13dac83081221b58110365ada040c7_0.webp\" alt=\"暗影像素重铸版图标\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/the-night-of-living-pumpkins\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/243c0c1904de2361e931432a6e0e5b0ee6b27e8f.png\" alt=\"南瓜活夜图标\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/potion-recipes-pixels-reforged-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/543bdae3a809c8f18421b8c685cb5acf2ee52502.png\" alt=\"药水配方：像素重铸版图标\" width=\"200\">\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5f88863218a1c549051bc37c2cbd07a395d1bdd2.png\" alt=\"你的支持至关重要\" width=\"850\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n如果你喜欢我制作的内容，不妨加入我的Patreon或Ko-fi，享受所有独家会员内容，你将获得大量额外福利，如制作过程、开发博客等！\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fshadows_pixelforge%252ftiers\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6dc8719629fd05f40aba4f4e58bc56458925abae.png\" alt=\"加入Ko-fi\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shadowspixelforge/membership\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e73a4a0852508cb8d2b6a3dae2a42baef09334c0.png\" alt=\"加入Patreon\" width=\"400\" height=\"50\"> </a> \n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c504b5dd2e5b02ad181da50f0336314e6dd7572.png\" alt=\"hr\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\">\n<br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fb424f5c7e4031e9d8691616a446883413c75421.png\" alt=\"常见问题\" width=\"155\" height=\"50\">\n</h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n\n<h4><strong> 问：药水配方：原版版是模组/整合包/数据包/插件...吗？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：不，这只是一个资源包！\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 问：你会制作基岩版移植版吗？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：要制作能在基岩版上运行的版本，我需要学习基岩版的工作原理。所以我目前不打算很快着手这件事，但最终会实现。\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 问：你现在或将来会制作模组吗？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：目前我主要做资源包，但我不排除在不久的将来制作与药水配方相关的新内容。\n<br><br><br>\n\n<h4><strong> 问：我可以将你的资源包加入我的整合包吗？ </strong></h4>\n- 答：可以，只要你给予我适当的鸣谢即可。\n\n</div>",
